{"id": "DezZdo0Pf5r", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"ACCESS\" to get the Higgsfield API to automate your AI content pipeline.\n\nThis one API is basically cheating for AI content.\n\nHiggsfield put all the best video and image models in one place.\n\nGenjutsu, Seedance, Kling, Soul, and Seedream, all behind a single API.\n\nIt's one connection instead of five.\n\nThink of it like one remote that controls every TV in the house.\n\nHere's why that's a big deal.\n\nYou can hook it straight into your automations or your AI agent.\n\nSo your agent writes the script.\n\nIt picks the model.\n\nAnd it generates the video itself.\n\nWith camera controls and character consistency built in.\n\nThat's a full production team inside one API.\n\nThis is lethal if you run a content pipeline.\n\nIt cuts out copying prompts between tabs.\n\nAnd switching between tools.\n\nEverything runs from one place.\n\nNo more jumping from app to app.\n\nThat saves you time on every single video.\n\nYour agent does the busy work.\n\nAnd you focus on the ideas.\n\n#higgsfieldAI #higgsfieldapi #aivideos #aiapi #seedance", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792686078, "like_count": 518, "comment_count": 647, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1146293655003354a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.644, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM6sLno3jjuy2fxS_LvT5mD5RDgUpVexgSexANP3jFNrO_mxDBAfJX3Nt92PNp9FbrFZs1FIzpsXBXHg_YxRZ56S9IhmGf9qQPc7Wo.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Adoakp0BH5IA4fciVy0_NWeHYAFHVC-eD6N5w805NZtmzwrXTETdLI9_BI6iuNXIPTw&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=qkwG5mpE680Q7kNvwHy9yKQ&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=cEgKjxJtK36YuywmRzubNA&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTj_XlW_TWZE7cSu_K5aepljgM